   "widgets_values": [
    "## sdxl-controlnet-canny.json\n\nControlNet canny\n\n**Does:** generation constrained by the *structure* of an input image (Canny edges) — the\nlayout transfers, the content and style are replaced.\n**Knobs:** `strength` ~0.8 holds structure while freeing style; the canny low/high thresholds\ncontrol edge density.\n**Superseded:** `controlnet-union.json` does this and more from **one** model. Use this only\nif you specifically want the SDXL-v2 canny model.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S2** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E2b** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "color": "#332922",
   "bgcolor": "#593930"
  }
